    "referrals": [
      "POL-RD-09(4) billing integrity: review the fare ledger for the phantom gantry line 'AYE (Alexandra Rd towards Tuas)' of $2.00, charged on trip TRP-00115 although the GPS trace never came within 5,419 m of that gantry (match radius 250 m) and the gantry is not on the optimal route; the line is refunded in full and the ledger entry is flagged."
